# colcon's output. SETUP0_ROSWorkspace.md has you build from ~/ros2_ws, which
# puts these outside this repository -- but running `colcon build` from inside
# an assignment folder instead puts them here, and committing them makes a
# submission tens of MB of object files and test logs. Nothing in them is
# graded: the autograder rebuilds the workspace from its own copy and reads
# only the Python files you wrote.
build/
install/
log/
